[I] Serial loader for i.MX5/6/7/8 series

[T] imx_loader (imx_usb_loader) is a recovery utility to download and
[T] execute code on Freescale/NXP i.MX5, i.MX6, i.MX7, i.MX8 and Vybrid SoCs
[T] through the Serial Download Protocol (SDP). It provides the imx_usb and
[T] imx_uart tools for USB and UART links.

[U] https://github.com/boundarydevices/imx_usb_loader

[A] Imx_loader Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

